PAYERS of the parish of Bossier are

hereby notified that I will be at the places
named herein, on the days mentioned, for the
purpose of collecting State and Parish Taxes.
Take time by the forelock, and meet me
promptly and save costs. I will be at

Haughton Station, Monday and Tuesday,
November 1st and 2d.;

Atkins Landing, Wednesday and Thursday,
November 4th and 5th;
Dortch & Pickett's Store, Friday, Nov 6;
Nicholson's Store, Saturday, Nov 7;
Bossier City, Monday and Tuesday, Nov 9th
and 10th;
Shady Grove, Wednesday, Nov 11th;
Willow Chute, Thursday, Nov 12th;

Benton, FRIDAY and Saturday, Nov 13th and 14th;
Pickett's Store, Monday, Nov 16th;
Dickson's Crossroads, Tuesday, Nov 17th;
Collinsburg, Wednesday and Thursday, Nov
18th and 19th;
Red Land, Friday and Saturday, November
20th and 21st;
Rocky Mount, Monday and Tuesday, Nov
23d and 24th;
Midway, Wednesday, Nov 25th;
Abercrombie City, Thursday, Nov 26th;

Foster's Store, Friday and Saturday, Nov
27th and 28th.
R. E. WYCHE, Sheriff and
Tax Collector.

